# History entries prior to 11.0

4 August 2021 Ben Morgan (test27-V10-07-05)
---------------------------------------------------
- Modernize CMake script allowing test to be built in system testing
  or as a standalone project

5 May 2021 Ben Morgan (test27-V10-07-04)
----------------------------------------
- Do not install tests

18 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test27-V10-07-03)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst27PhysicsList : replaced G4HadronCaptureProcess with
  G4NeutronCaptureProcess.

08 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test27-V10-07-02)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst27PhysicsList : replaced old G4IonShenCrossSection class
  (that has been deleted) with G4ComponentGGNuclNuclXsc.

04 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test27-V10-07-01)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst27PhysicsList : replaced particle-specific inelastic hadronic
  processes (that have been deleted) with G4HadronInelasticProcess.

18 February 2021 Ben Morgan (test27-V10-07-00)
----------------------------------------------
- Support same CMake version range as core Geant4

08 May 2019  V.Ivanchenko  (test27-V10-05-00)
------------------------------------------------
- Use QGSP_BIC and MixMax random engine

9-August-2018 A.Ribon     (test27-V10-04-00)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
- Tst27PhysicsList : replaced the explicit high-energy limit of hadronic
  physics with the one from G4HadronicParameters .

13-October-2016 G.Folger  (test27-V10-02-00)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
- remove direct use of theParticleIterator, use GetParticleTableIterator().
    fix required by clang39 on Windows and MAC

6 June 2014 Gunter Folger  (test27-V10-00-00 - never actually tagged
-------------------------------------------------------------------
- Allow to use factory, if list name given as 2nd argument
- add, in comment, randon number store/restore in test27.in

19 July 2013  Dennis Wright                      (test27-V09-06-03)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
- Tst27PhysicsList: remove fission process and model, replace G4LCapture
  with G4NeutronRadCapture

2 July 2013  Dennis Wright                       (test27-V09-06-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
- Tst27PhysicsList: replace LEP models with Bertini, FTFP

11 June 2013  Dennis Wright                      (test27-V09-06-01)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
- Migrate to multi-threaded:
    added option to use G4MTRunManager in test27.cc
    created class Tst27ActionInitialization and moved some user init methods
      there
    added empty method Tst27GeometryConstruction::ConstructSDandField()

- added CMakeLists_Standalone.txt to be used for stand-alone running
  (developed by Makoto Asai)

- updated README for cmake build

04-Feb-2013, Gunter Folger                       (test27-V09-06-00)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
-  Do not create customised de-excitation and precompound, these get reused
    in binary creating energy non-conservation

09-Oct-2012, Gabriele Cosmo                      (test27-V09-05-01)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
